  - m_Id: 136808528593170434
    m_Localized: "<color=#4B4E6D>2</color>      V\xEDtejte v Cargor!\n<color=#4B4E6D>3</color>     
      Z\xE1kladn\xED pohyb\n<color=#4B4E6D>4</color>      Jak balit produkty\n<color=#4B4E6D>5</color>     
      Ukl\xE1d\xE1n\xED do reg\xE1l\u016F\n<color=#4B4E6D>6</color>      Kamiony
      a doru\u010Dov\xE1n\xED\n<color=#4B4E6D>7</color>       Z\xE1kazn\xEDci\n<line-height=18><color=#4B4E6D>8</color>     
      Speci\xE1ln\xED po\u017Eadavky: vratky,\ndvojit\xE9 objedn\xE1vky, sm\xED\u0161en\xE9
      kamiony</line-height>\n<color=#4B4E6D>9</color>      N\xE1jem a va\u0161e pen\xEDze\n<color=#4B4E6D>10</color>  
      Vylep\u0161en\xED\n<color=#4B4E6D>11</color>    N\xE1st\u011Bnka \xFAkol\u016F\n<color=#4B4E6D>12</color>   
      Telefonn\xED linka\n<color=#4B4E6D>13</color>    Odpo\u010Dinkov\xE1 m\xEDstnost
      a konec dne\n<color=#4B4E6D>14</color>    Tipy pro t\xFDmovou pr\xE1ci"
